.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-mr-merge 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-mr\-merge \- Merge into the target branch and publish (root or maintainer key)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm mr merge\fR [\fB\-\-no\-push\fR] [\fB\-R\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-offline\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIMR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merge into the target branch and publish (root or maintainer key)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-push\fR
Make the merge commit but do not push it
.TP
\fB\-R\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR
A repo ID or link; by default the swarm remote of this clone
.TP
\fB\-\-offline\fR
Use what is already here instead of syncing first
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIMR\fR>
Its branch or ID
